//
// Conventions: signature (-+++); X^A = z^A + L^A_mu x^mu with
// L = B(rapidity) S(s0, sigma, s_sym); S^0_0 = 1 + s0, S^0_j = +sigma_j,
// S^i_0 = -sigma^i, S^i_j = delta^i_j + s_ij symmetric; source point
// x = L^{-1}(X - (0, center_offset)). Tolerance: relative 1e-12.

